  "body": "In the table under step 8 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#determining-the-character-encoding , change gb18030 to GBK. Both decode the same way per the Encoding Standard, but GBK doesn't generate 4-byte sequences in form submission. Sites that are legacy enough to have unlabeled content might not be able to deal with the 4-byte sequences.\r\n\r\n(Firefox uses GBK instead of gb18030.)",
